    <string name="disclosure_title">Accessibility disclosure</string>
    <string name="disclosure_body">AuraMic Accessibility Service ka use sirf ek kaam ke liye karta hai: voice note record karne ke baad aap jis chat mein the use chunna aur aapke chat app (WhatsApp, WhatsApp Business, Telegram ya Instagram) ke andar Send button dabana, taaki note bina extra tap ke bhej diya jaye.\n\nYeh sirf un chat apps mein kaam karti hai jinhe aap Settings mein on karte hain. Yeh aapke messages, contacts ya koi personal data na padhti hai, na store karti hai, na share karti hai. Audio aapke device par hi process hoti hai.</string>
